10
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,799
You old bastard!

11
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:26,840
Mu Ying!

12
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:28,760
Mu Ying!

13
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,239
I thought I'd never see you again.

14
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,319
I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm fine.

15
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:31,959
I'm so glad you're okay.

16
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:32,719
Alright, alright, alright.

17
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:33,680
I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm fine.

18
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:34,480
Look.

19
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,079
I'm fine. I'm fine.

20
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:37,599
I'm just glad you're okay.

21
00:01:38,079 --> 00:01:39,400
Not for kids.

22
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,000
How did you escape?

23
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,760
He locked me in that granary by the river.

24
00:01:45,159 --> 00:01:46,280
There happened to be a hidden door inside,

25
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,159
so I smashed it open.

26
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,480
A flimsy little warehouse

27
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:50,599
