28
00:01:50,799 --> 00:01:51,799
And releasing poison gas?

29
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:52,560
Pah!

30
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:53,799
You are so vicious.

31
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,599
You old bastard.

32
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,200
Right, right, right.

33
00:01:55,879 --> 00:01:56,920
You inhaled the poison gas.

34
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,040
Let's hurry to the hospital.

35
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:58,799
Wait, wait.

36
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,120
Don't worry.

37
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,079
I didn't inhale it.

38
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,560
When he released the poison gas,

39
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:03,599
I held my breath.

40
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,519
I barely breathed in any.

41
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,200
I'm fine.

42
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:06,040
I really didn't.

43
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,799
I'm fine, look.

44
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:09,280
Impressive.

45
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,360
I'm glad you're okay.

46
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:11,319
I'm glad you're okay.

47
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:12,479
I'll cuff him first.

48
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:13,520
Okay.

49
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,599
Master,

50
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,960
