54
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:27,400
What do we do next?

55
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,520
Next,

56
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,240
we'll go take a look first.

57
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,560
Let's see the vault he schemed so hard for.

58
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:33,879
Once we find it,

59
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:35,319
I'll notify the Cultural Relics Bureau to take over.

60
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,319
Where is it?

61
00:02:37,199 --> 00:02:38,280
Sihua Street, North Alley.

62
00:02:39,479 --> 00:02:40,840
I've never heard of this place.

63
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:42,639
It might be

64
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:43,759
