65
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,159
We'll find out once we look up the address.

66
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:46,000
Alright.

67
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,680
You guys go research the info,

68
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,000
and I'll take him back to the police station.

69
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:49,639
Okay.

70
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,560
Be careful.

71
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:53,800
Let's go.

72
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:54,560
Move.

73
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,879
Congratulations, Ms. Mu Ying,

74
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:04,400
