75
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,800
Good morning, Police Chief.

76
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,360
Good morning, Police Chief.

77
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,080
Morning, good morning.

78
00:03:09,759 --> 00:03:10,439
Stop talking nonsense.

79
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,719
What's going on?

80
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,120
Why is everyone here today?

81
00:03:13,719 --> 00:03:14,840
Congratulations, Police Chief Mu Ying.

82
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,439
Because you solved the relic theft case,

83
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,560
and caught the Yanbei Master Thief,

84
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:22,199
Director Wu of the Provincial Bureau issued your Letter of Appointment.

85
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,360
You're officially promoted.

86
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,479
You are now the official Police Chief.

87
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,520
I...

88
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:28,639
I'm officially promoted?

89
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,479
Yes.

90
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,039
I'm officially promoted!

91
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,159
Yes, Police Chief.

92
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,800
I've become the Police Chief!

93
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,400
If only my Dad knew.

94
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,479
Mu Gui was convicted of dereliction of duty

95
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:44,520
and sentenced to five years.

96
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,599
He's currently serving time in prison.

97
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,240
Police Chief Mu,

98
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:49,719
to tell you the truth,

99
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,400
you're more righteous than your Dad.

100
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,840
You are decisive and resolute.

101
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,159
You're even tougher than us men.

102
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,159
We will all follow your orders from now on.

103
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,560
All officers of Lijia Town Police Station

104
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,199
await the Police Chief's orders!

105
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,960
Await the Police Chief's orders!

106
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,560
Mu Ying.

107
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:08,960
Mu Ying.

108
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,520
What is it?

109
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,960
The former Sihua Street, North Alley

110
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:16,120
corresponds to the location of

111
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,959
the present-day Hu Port.

112
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,319
The vault should be located right there.

113
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:21,680
Then let's go!

114
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:23,160
But this...

115
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:25,319
They...

116
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:26,600
Everyone is here today.

117
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,040
Keep this safe.

118
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:28,759
Let's go.

119
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:29,319
Okay.

120
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:32,199
Dismissed!

121
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:47,759
I compared the ancient and modern maps.

122
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,800
Actually, the location of the vault

123
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:52,959
is right here.

124
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,680
No.

125
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,120
Are you sure about this?

126
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,439
The vault is here?

127
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,399
But where is it?

128
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,319
There was a flood the year before last.

129
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,839
They opened the canal to release the water.

130
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,360
The vault

131
00:05:07,079 --> 00:05:08,120
was submerged at the bottom of the river.

132
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:10,519
The so-called Sihua Street, North Alley

133
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:13,399
actually refers to this place.

134
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,160
You mean,

135
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:17,240
the vault sank to the bottom of the river?

136
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:18,680
Master,

137
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,839
are the treasures inside still there?

138
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,439
The current is rapid.

139
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:26,759
The treasures must have been washed away.

140
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:32,560
Benefactor Li grew greedy for the Golden Tomb.

141
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,759
He killed his three accomplices

142
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:36,000
to keep the gold to himself.

143
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:38,519
To keep this secret safe,

144
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,199
he also killed

145
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:42,600
Elder Ding and his grandson, who lived at the Golden Tomb's exit.

146
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,360
He was blinded by greed

147
00:05:46,079 --> 00:05:47,160
and murdered five people.

148
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:48,560
It's unforgivable.

149
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,160
The Old Newsvendor,

150
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,079
in order to monopolize the vault

151
00:05:54,279 --> 00:05:55,560
and escape the law,

152
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:56,639
Put this on.

153
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,480
had his accomplice, the Spirit Medium,

154
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:00,360
poison Benefactor Li to death.

155
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:01,839
Then,

156
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,759
he poisoned the Spirit Medium too.

157
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:08,079
Plus the three innocent wives

158
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,800
and Mengzhu who died tragically.

159
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:14,839
Two vaults.

160
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,560
Eleven lives.

161
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,759
All of these sins

162
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:22,000
stem from an obsession with ill-gotten wealth.

163
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,480
The heaviest shackles in the world

164
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:28,399
aren't money itself,

165
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,360
but the obsession with ill-gotten wealth.

166
00:06:33,959 --> 00:06:35,680
The vanity built by money

167
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:38,480
will eventually, under the light of conscience,

168
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,439
vanish into nothing.

169
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,040
As the saying goes,

170
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,759
All conditioned phenomena

171
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,560
are like dreams, illusions, bubbles, and shadows.

172
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,000
That's right.

173
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,399
My Dad was also driven by greed,

174
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,160
and let Benefactor Li go.

175
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,639
Now he's a prisoner.

176
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:02,759
I have to go back and see him.

177
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,000
What are you doing here?

178
00:07:36,279 --> 00:07:36,720
Dad.

179
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,920
I made you some dumplings.

180
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,240
Eat them while they're hot.

181
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,519
You're the one who turned me in.

182
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,240
And you have the nerve to show up.

183
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,120
The remains of Elder Ding and his grandson

184
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,399
have been found at the bottom of the river.

185
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,480
Benefactor Li has also confessed.

186
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,800
He committed countless crimes and was poisoned to death.

187
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,040
If you hadn't let him go back then,

188
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:09,000
these revenge murders wouldn't have happened.

189
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:12,079
I reported you

190
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,079
because I didn't want to see

191
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:16,240
people like Chunmei have nowhere to turn for justice.

192
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:19,879
I reported you.

193
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,279
Was I wrong?

194
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:37,080
Way too salty. Are you trying to kill me with salt?

195
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,000
Did you kill the salt merchant?

196
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,080
Eat it or don't.

197
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,279
You're so hard to please.

198
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,200
Stop right there.

199
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,080
I haven't died from the salt yet.

200
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,440
You didn't even bring a bowl of soup with you.

201
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:55,840
I'll go buy you some.

202
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:08,679
Dad.

203
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:11,960
Dad!

204
00:09:14,879 --> 00:09:16,000
I became the Police Chief!

205
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,120
I want some lotus root and pork rib soup.

206
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:40,679
Got it.

207
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,639
Print 500 more copies of Heavenly Craftsmanship.

208
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:06,159
The book has 209 pages.

209
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,320
That'll be 100 silver dollars in total.

210
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,120
Excuse me.

211
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,399
You got it wrong.

212
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:11,519
This book...

213
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:12,919
should have 210 pages.

214
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,159
Master.

215
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,799
How did you know that?

216
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,559
Heavenly Craftsmanship

217
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:20,480
is the most important book in our library.

218
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:22,000
Of course I know it inside out.

219
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:24,720
It only has 209 pages.

220
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,440
The last page was torn out.

221
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:33,879
We don't have enough money.

222
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,639
We're short by 20.

223
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:36,840
Sir.

224
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:37,960
How about this?

225
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,679
Start printing it for me first.

226
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,000
When it's time to settle the bill,

227
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,639
I'll pay you the remaining 20.

228
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:44,639
Okay.

229
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:45,720
Alright, thank you.

230
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:49,720
Master.

231
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:51,360
That's 20 we're talking about.

232
00:10:51,679 --> 00:10:53,240
Have some faith in yourself.

233
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,759
With your eloquence,

234
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:55,879
with three days of storytelling,

235
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:58,519
you can easily earn that 20, right?

236
00:10:58,879 --> 00:10:59,639
I earn it?

237
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:01,399
What?

238
00:11:02,039 --> 00:11:02,960
Why do I have to earn it?

239
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:07,159
Did you take our experience in Lijia Town

240
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:08,200
and turn it into a story script?

241
00:11:09,519 --> 00:11:10,039
Smart.

242
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,200
So, my Master,

243
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,200
with his ability of Five Senses Deduction,

244
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:23,279
solved a wrongful case.

245
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,440
Just recently,

246
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:26,360
he took a stroll outside the Li family's gold shop

247
00:11:26,720 --> 00:11:28,080
and perfectly reconstructed

248
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:30,240
the full story of the Li family gold shop burglary.

249
00:11:30,679 --> 00:11:31,200
It turns out,

250
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:33,799
the night watchman was a spy for a gang of thieves.

251
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,200
They poisoned a wealthy family's bride.

252
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:38,960
After killing her, they impersonated the King of Hell

253
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:40,360
and stole the bride's corpse.

254
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,200
They also took all the gold jewelry

255
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,320
from the Li family's gold shop

256
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:45,600
that the bride's corpse was wearing.

257
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:46,879
They even spread rumors about

258
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,519
the King of Hell's Wedding

259
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:50,279
to divert the police's attention.

260
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,720
In reality,

261
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:53,440
what this gang of thieves

262
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,720
really wanted to steal

263
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:56,840
was the gold shop of the richest man, Benefactor Li.

264
00:11:57,279 --> 00:11:58,799
But no matter how resourceful the thieves were,

265
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,600
they couldn't escape my Master's keen eyes.

266
00:12:00,639 --> 00:12:01,159
Jiang Huai.

267
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:04,039
I know what caused your hallucinations.

268
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:04,440
Come with me.

269
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:07,120
They also made up the Five Ghosts Carrying Wealth story to disrupt the case.

270
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,000
Doctor.

271
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,559
It's just that...

272
00:12:19,759 --> 00:12:21,759
After the fire in our family's library,

273
00:12:22,519 --> 00:12:23,240
my eyes

274
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:24,759
became very strange.

275
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,960
I keep seeing unusual things.

276
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:28,279
He takes forever to explain.

277
00:12:28,759 --> 00:12:29,679
He keeps having hallucinations.

278
00:12:29,919 --> 00:12:30,919
Doctor, what's wrong with him?

279
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,440
The smoke from the fire

280
00:12:33,639 --> 00:12:35,399
damaged part of your retinas,

281
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,559
causing your eyes

282
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:38,320
to lose some visual function.

283
00:12:38,519 --> 00:12:38,919
As a result,

284
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:39,639
your brain

285
00:12:39,759 --> 00:12:41,200
will, within your field of vision,

286
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,159
automatically generate imaginary images.

287
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:45,120
So it's an eye disease

288
00:12:45,279 --> 00:12:46,399
causing visual hallucinations.

289
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:47,080
Yes.

290
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:49,159
You don't need to worry too much about it.

291
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:50,679
After taking some medication,

292
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,600
your retinas will heal on their own.

293
00:12:53,559 --> 00:12:54,080
Thank you.

294
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:54,840
No problem.

295
00:12:55,679 --> 00:12:56,519
See, I told you.

296
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:57,879
It was all in your head.

297
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:58,720
Don't think about it anymore.

298
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:00,120
But...

299
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,039
that's not right.

300
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:07,159
Elder Ding and Xiaobao...

301
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,159
they are real.

302
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,120
You've never seen them.

303
00:13:10,399 --> 00:13:11,080
How could you imagine them?

304
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:17,919
The newspaper.

305
00:13:19,679 --> 00:13:21,080
I saw them in the newspaper.

306
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:31,320
Master.

307
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:33,320
What character is this?

308
00:13:34,799 --> 00:13:35,519
Oh, this one?

309
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:37,519
This is "ni".

310
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,080
It means to drown.

311
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:45,360
Grandfather and Grandson in Lijia Town Drown After Accidental Fall.

312
00:13:47,159 --> 00:13:48,120
How pitiful.

313
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:58,919
Look here.

314
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,639
Xiaobao, don't run around.

315
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:02,720
Xiaobao!

316
00:14:05,519 --> 00:14:06,480
Be careful not to fall.

317
00:14:09,639 --> 00:14:10,240
So nice.

318
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,159
Police Chief.

319
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:24,120
A telegram from the Provincial Bureau.

320
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:32,080
A murder involving evil Zhuyou Sorcery happened in Wu City.

321
00:14:32,559 --> 00:14:35,399
They want you to go to Wu City to assist with the investigation.

322
00:14:36,519 --> 00:14:37,240
Wu City.

323
00:14:37,799 --> 00:14:39,240
I've heard about the case in Wu City.

324
00:14:39,679 --> 00:14:41,240
Several people died from being possessed.

325
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:42,759
No murder weapon.

326
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:43,840
No witnesses.

327
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,639
Many villagers were so scared they moved away.

328
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:47,600
It's completely bizarre.

329
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:48,799
Police Chief,

330
00:14:49,399 --> 00:14:50,159
you can't go!

331
00:14:50,399 --> 00:14:51,240
It's quite interesting.

332
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,720
I'll go to Wu City and see for myself.

333
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,120
As for you,

334
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,240
stay in Lijia Town.

335
00:14:56,759 --> 00:14:57,440
Keep things in order.

336
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,480
Keep up the good work.

337
00:14:58,759 --> 00:14:59,240
I'm off.

338
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,200
Don't worry, Police Chief.

339
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:18,840
She-devil!

340
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:20,159
Why is it you again?

341
00:15:20,639 --> 00:15:21,480
This can't be good.

342
00:15:21,879 --> 00:15:22,799
It's good news.

343
00:15:23,559 --> 00:15:24,399
The Provincial Bureau...

344
00:15:24,559 --> 00:15:27,840
...wants me to investigate a Zhuyou Sorcery murder in Wu City.

345
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,279
The three of us should go together.

346
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:30,080
What do you say?

347
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:31,799
I'm applying medicine to my eyes.

348
00:15:32,399 --> 00:15:32,919
I'm not going.

349
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,240
I'm not going either.

350
00:15:34,559 --> 00:15:35,360
You never feed us...

351
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,039
...and you always boss me around.

352
00:15:38,279 --> 00:15:39,200
This time is different.

353
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:41,879
I'll cover your room, board, and everything else.

354
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,559
I also heard...

355
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,600
...that over in Wu City...

356
00:15:49,919 --> 00:15:52,639
...is the last page of Heavenly Craftsmanship.

357
00:15:53,399 --> 00:15:54,559
If you don't want to go, forget it.

358
00:15:54,799 --> 00:15:55,519
I'll just go by myself.

359
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,440
In that case...

360
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,000
Off to Wu City!

361
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:05,879
Let's go! Let's go!

362
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:14,240
They set off to investigate the strange Zhuyou Sorcery case.

363
00:16:14,759 --> 00:16:16,399
The journey ahead is long...

364
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,799
...and full of unknown dangers.

365
00:16:18,399 --> 00:16:19,039
Dear audience,

366
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,639
the tale of the strange mansion in Lijia Town...

367
00:16:22,039 --> 00:16:23,080
...comes to a close here.

368
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,559
As the saying goes,

369
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,879
What goes around comes around.

370
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,720
A snake trying to swallow an elephant.

371
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,519
To find out what happens next...

372
00:16:29,879 --> 00:16:32,080
...stay tuned for the next chapter.

373
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,159
Bravo!

374
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:35,440
Wonderful! Good! Good!

375
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,039
Fantastic!
